Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:06:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/34] Extend the thrift interface

Add player status and stream events to the browser, and subtitle
track selection, end of stream and stream event filters to VDR.
Regenerated with thrift 0.24.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
